## Story Description
Update src/recommendations/rules.py so all rule methods use SavingsRates for rate lookups and apply addressability_pct to the baseline. Read the full file before making changes. (1) In __init__: add self._rates = SavingsRates() (import from src.recommendations.savings_rates). (2) rule_supplier_consolidation: for each category group, call rates_row = self._rates.get('SUPPLIER_CONSOLIDATION', category); saving_pct = rates_row['saving_pct']; addressability_pct = rates_row['addressability_pct']; addressable_baseline = category_spend * addressability_pct; estimated_impact = addressable_baseline * saving_pct. Add fields baseline_spend=round(category_spend,2), addressability_pct=addressability_pct, saving_pct=saving_pct, addressable_baseline=round(addressable_baseline,2), category_l1=category (the L2 here, best available) to the rec dict. Update evidence string to include addressability info. (3) rule_competitive_tender: same pattern with 'COMPETITIVE_TENDER'; use cfg.competitive_tender_min_spend instead of hardcoded 50_000. (4) rule_contract_coverage_gap: same pattern with 'CONTRACT_COVERAGE_GAP'; use cfg.contract_coverage_gap_min_spend instead of hardcoded 20_000; baseline_spend = total_spend, addressable_baseline = unmanaged_spend * addressability_pct. (5) rule_tail_spend_rationalisation: get rates = self._rates.get('TAIL_SPEND_RATIONALISATION'); addressability_pct from rates; baseline_spend = tail_spend_amount; addressable_baseline = baseline_spend * addressability_pct; estimated_impact = addressable_baseline * rates['saving_pct']. (6) rule_maverick_spend: same pattern with 'CONTRACT_COMPLIANCE'. (7) rule_payment_term_extension: get rates = self._rates.get('PAYMENT_TERM_EXTENSION'); addressability_pct from rates; annual_spend_addressable = annual_spend * addressability_pct; estimated_impact = (target - current) / 365.0 * annual_spend_addressable * cfg.wacc; add baseline_spend=round(annual_spend,2), addressability_pct=addressability_pct, saving_pct=None, addressable_baseline=round(annual_spend_addressable,2).

